rectedSystemModels}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}directed\\text{-}system\\text{-}models}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8DirectedSystemModels}_S(\\mathcal D;I,\\preceq,L,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{DirectedPreorder}(I,\\preceq)\n\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists\\vec M,\\vec\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\pi,\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I^2:i\\preceq j\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\pi))\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle\\vec M,\\vec\\pi\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\vec M(i),L)\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\vec M(i),T))\n\\land\n\\forall i\\preceq j\\;\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(\\vec\\pi(\\langle i,j\\rangle),\\vec M(i),\\vec M(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\vec\\pi(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathrm{Univ}(\\vec M(i))})\n\\land\n\\forall i\\preceq j\\preceq k\\;\n(\\vec\\pi(\\langle i,k\\rangle)=\\vec\\pi(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\circ\\vec\\pi(\\langle i,j\\rangle))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}directed\\text{-}system\\text{-}models}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8DirectedSystemModels}_S(\\mathcal D;I,\\preceq,L,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{DirectedPreorder}(I,\\preceq)\n\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists\\vec M,\\vec\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\pi,\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I^2:i\\preceq j\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\pi))\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle\\vec M,\\vec\\pi\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\vec M(i),L)\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\vec M(i),T))\n\\land\n\\forall i\\preceq j\\;\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(\\vec\\pi(\\langle i,j\\rangle),\\vec M(i),\\vec M(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\vec\\pi(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathrm{Univ}(\\vec M(i))})\n\\land\n\\forall i\\preceq j\\preceq k\\;\n(\\vec\\pi(\\langle i,k\\rangle)=\\vec\\pi(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\circ\\vec\\pi(\\langle i,j\\rangle))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The object and arrow families are set-coded functions; modelhood and elementary-embedding claims reuse their canonical predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_o